    {
      "title": "四、ADB 常用命令（座舱测试通用）",
      "icon": "💺",
      "content_blocks": [
        {
          "type": "code",
          "language": "bash",
          "code": "# 连接\nadb devices                          # 查看设备\nadb connect 192.168.x.x              # 网络连接\n\n# 日志\nadb logcat -v time > log.txt         # 全量日志\nadb logcat | grep -i \"error\\|crash\\|ANR\"\n\n# 性能\nadb shell top -n 1 | head -20        # CPU排行\nadb shell dumpsys meminfo            # 内存详情\nadb shell dumpsys gfxinfo            # 帧率\nadb shell dumpsys input              # 触控事件\n\n# Monkey\nadb shell monkey -p <包名> -v 20000 --throttle 200\n\n# 截图录屏\nadb shell screencap /sdcard/screen.png\nadb shell screenrecord /sdcard/video.mp4"
        },
        {
          "type": "blockquote",
          "style": "面试说",
          "text": "**面试说**：\"ADB是座舱测试的基本功——不是背命令，是知道什么时候用哪个。看ANR用 logcat | grep ANR、查性能用 top + dumpsys meminfo、查触屏延迟用 dumpsys input → systrace 逐帧追 Input→UI 渲染链路。\""
        },
        {
          "type": "hr"
        }
      ],
      "has_compare": false,
